WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.920
Ikite ikite ikitsukuse

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:09.380
Hikari o mirai e

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:23.290
Uragirareta kodoku na sekai ni torinokosare

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:28.830
Miushinatta ashita o osorete ima mo

00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:31.960
Ibasho o sagasu

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:38.460
Hitsuyou to saretai kokoro no sakebi

00:00:39.670 --> 00:00:47.210
Karamiau IDENTITY tashikametainda shinjite iikana

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:50.580
Ikite ikite ikitsukuse

00:00:50.580 --> 00:00:54.580
Hikari o mirai e

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:58.080
Tatoe subete ushinattemo

00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:02.460
Kibou o tsunaide

00:01:02.670 --> 00:01:06.170
Boku ga koko ni iru imi

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:10.040
Ima wa wakaranakute mo ii

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:13.920
Kimi to waraiaeru you ni

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:19.830
Jibun de tachikitte susumudake

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:39.080
It's me, Shutina.

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:39.710
Come in.

00:01:42.420 --> 00:01:45.210
Today's meeting will proceed as planned.

00:01:45.210 --> 00:01:46.080
I see.

00:01:46.380 --> 00:01:49.880
Queen Echidna is expected to promote you
to a leadership role alongside us.

00:01:51.290 --> 00:01:53.080
It's finally happening.

00:01:53.710 --> 00:01:55.880
I've one matter to discuss before the meeting.

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:59.040
Mernes told us about you.

00:01:59.380 --> 00:02:02.670
Did you really lie about your reasons for joining us?

00:02:03.710 --> 00:02:06.460
I'll discuss that today, as well as my reasons.

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:11.540
Trust me. I won't betray you.

00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:14.380
All right.

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:18.750
Do not reveal your identity until I say so.

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:21.710
If we don't tread carefully with the reveal,

00:02:21.710 --> 00:02:24.380
Queen Echidna may not forgive the subterfuge.

00:02:24.920 --> 00:02:26.380
We don't want that.

00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:30.670
I'll signal you when the time is right. Understood?

00:02:30.670 --> 00:02:31.710
Understood.

00:02:32.580 --> 00:02:33.380
What's that?

00:02:33.380 --> 00:02:35.960
Oh, I felt like enjoying a book.

00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:38.460
"Eibrad, the Joiner of Hands"!

00:02:38.460 --> 00:02:41.460
Queen Echidna often read that tome.

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:43.750
Leo.

00:02:44.580 --> 00:02:48.210
Do you think we will be able to possess
the Philosopher's Stone?

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:52.670
It won't be easy, but we'll make it work.

00:02:53.170 --> 00:02:54.460
With my help.

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:58.580
When the preparations are complete,
I will send a messenger.

00:02:58.790 --> 00:02:59.750
Got it.

00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:01.040
Until then.

00:03:04.670 --> 00:03:09.000
Sheesh... This doesn't look like him at all.

00:03:15.460 --> 00:03:18.380
Whoa, hold it, why're you puttin' it like that?!

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:21.170
Don't make us out to be the bad guys, here!

00:03:21.420 --> 00:03:24.540
We didn't come here to attack humanity!

00:03:29.790 --> 00:03:35.580
I can't speak for the others,
but us imps wanted to be professional about it.

00:03:35.920 --> 00:03:39.170
You guys might not know,
but the Demon World's full of conflict and war,

00:03:39.170 --> 00:03:41.540
and we are sick of it.

00:03:41.790 --> 00:03:43.130
Why did you come, then?

00:03:43.130 --> 00:03:46.290
The Demon King's experiments accidentally
opened a Great Spirit Portal.

00:03:46.290 --> 00:03:49.130
That's the hole that connects your world to ours.

00:03:49.380 --> 00:03:51.830
The way was open, so we decided to come take a look.

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:54.880
Heard it was nicer than the Demon World, anyway.

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:56.960
Immigration, then?

00:03:57.170 --> 00:04:00.670
Basically. Plus, we were curious.

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:01.790
Curious?

00:04:02.130 --> 00:04:05.580
It ain't easy getting to the Human World
from the Demon World.

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:07.920
You need lots of catalysts and a lot of mana.

00:04:07.920 --> 00:04:10.670
Get those together and you can hold
a portal open long enough.

00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:13.830
Very few of us had ever seen the human world
with the naked eye before all this.

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:16.130
Wouldn't you wanna see it for yourself?

00:04:17.670 --> 00:04:21.500
Good, they're not gonna try to kill me
while they're listening to me talk!

00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:23.670
Who cares what I talk about as long as
I can keep them occupied!

00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:25.630
What happened next?

00:04:25.750 --> 00:04:29.040
This world was pretty damn interesting.

00:04:29.380 --> 00:04:31.630
But the best part was all the peace!

00:04:31.880 --> 00:04:34.210
Which was ended by your arrival.

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:36.960
Hey, I wanted to get along with you guys, remember?

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:40.670
I'm through with the Demon World
and its endless fighting!

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:43.630
The leaders of the Demon World
do not resolve disputes?

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:49.330
Belial's a shit king! He resolves everything with violence!

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:51.040
Belial?

00:04:51.250 --> 00:04:55.000
He's the ruler of the Demon World.
His Majesty, King Belial.

00:04:56.130 --> 00:04:59.040
That name is present in human records as well.

00:04:59.290 --> 00:05:05.330
One of our royals or nobles probably popped over
to your world back in the day.

00:05:05.790 --> 00:05:08.960
That's probably the reason
Belial's name is in your books.

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:10.540
I see.

00:05:12.670 --> 00:05:17.380
Shit, they sound totally bored!
I gotta keep this conversation going!

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:20.750
And their sword's so loud! It's scary as shit!

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:23.580
I'm not boring you, am I?

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:27.290
No, your explanation was very informative. Thank you.

00:05:27.790 --> 00:05:30.630
Dammit! I have no idea what they're thinking!

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:33.040
I gotta do something, or I'm dead meat!

00:05:34.170 --> 00:05:35.290
Please stand.

00:05:35.290 --> 00:05:37.880
H-hold on! I'm not done talking!

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:39.420
Let's walk.

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:42.920
W-walk where?!

00:05:49.920 --> 00:05:53.460
Why did Belial open the Great Spirit Portal?

00:05:53.960 --> 00:05:55.040
Huh? Oh.

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:58.500
We weren't even thinking about invasion at first.

00:05:58.880 --> 00:06:04.080
All the Demon World's wars are fought over
the limited resources it has to offer.

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:09.210
Then Belial opened a portal to
an uninhabited island in the human world,

00:06:09.210 --> 00:06:11.830
and we started talking about moving over.

00:06:16.460 --> 00:06:19.580
Yet the portal was opened in the center of Tokyo.

00:06:20.040 --> 00:06:22.540
Yeah, that surprised me, too!

00:06:22.960 --> 00:06:27.580
And thanks to those instinct-driven types
like ogres and ghouls attacking humans,

00:06:27.580 --> 00:06:29.500
we had a war on our hands almost immediately.

00:06:30.130 --> 00:06:32.460
That's why we freaked out and tried to leave!

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:34.250
Huh?!

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:37.080
Whoa, what?! Why's it closing up?!

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:42.420
It sucks.

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:47.710
The only beings capable of closing up the Great Spirit
Portal were high-tier demons or King Belial himself.

00:06:48.080 --> 00:06:52.250
Their plan from the start was
to leave us to die in the human world.

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:58.330
Is there a possibility that Belial and these high-tier
demons will try to colonize our world?

00:06:58.330 --> 00:07:04.420
Oh, totally. Don't take this personally,
but you humans are way weaker than us.

00:07:06.040 --> 00:07:08.880
There were probably some spies
who crossed over with us

00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:13.290
and snuck back to the Demon World before the portal
closed up.

00:07:13.670 --> 00:07:17.170
I bet they're telling Belial all
about you guys right about now.

00:07:17.710 --> 00:07:22.920
"Now's the time to assemble your forces
and take the human world for your own!"

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:27.580
I mean, you've gotta know how much
more power we've got over you guys.

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:31.920
Engaging a single devil requires
a minimum of a three-man cell.

00:07:32.420 --> 00:07:36.040
Man, it feels weird bein' called a devil...

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:38.750
Devils are the ruling class of the Demon World.

00:07:40.380 --> 00:07:41.500
Never mind.

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:46.290
They're way more powerful than the rest of us,
and boy do they use it to their advantage.

00:07:46.630 --> 00:07:51.670
High-tier demons look down on us lower-tier demons
like we're the gum on their shoe.

00:07:51.960 --> 00:07:54.580
You get why we were so eager to get over here, yeah?

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:57.540
I cannot empathize, but I can understand.

00:07:59.210 --> 00:08:01.250
Thanks, man.

00:08:01.670 --> 00:08:02.920
You are a man, right?

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:08.170
I have no gender, but I was designed
to appear masculine.

00:08:08.540 --> 00:08:09.330
You were DESIGNED...?

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:17.630
Welp, guess all I can do now
is just wait till someone kills me.

00:08:18.960 --> 00:08:23.540
"Oh, go to the Human World!
The sun's warm and bright, and it's lush and green!"

00:08:23.830 --> 00:08:28.000
Yeah, right! Everywhere I go it's one giant grey
tombstone after another!

00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:34.080
Those high-tier devils can kiss my ass!
They should be the ones getting killed!

00:08:35.170 --> 00:08:37.500
I'm done! Just finish me off already!

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:42.670
Thank you for the valuable information.

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:45.960
You're not gonna kill me?!

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:48.710
You provided me with valuable information,

00:08:49.080 --> 00:08:53.170
and I am escorting you to
the Containment Squadron rendezvous point.

00:08:56.540 --> 00:08:57.250
Yes?

00:08:58.670 --> 00:09:02.630
Nothing. Just thinking about how different
you are from the other humans.

00:09:05.540 --> 00:09:08.080
Come to think of it, he was acting weird from the start...

00:09:20.460 --> 00:09:23.130
A monster that's neither human nor demon...

00:09:24.210 --> 00:09:26.130
What the hell is he?

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:29.960
You appear to be a rather understanding devil.

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:34.460
I will see to it that command finds you
a residence in the Shinjuku Protection Ward.

00:09:35.330 --> 00:09:38.170
I'd rather get back to the Demon World if I can.

00:09:38.710 --> 00:09:41.790
We have nearly reached
the Containment Squadron rendezvous point.

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:44.250
Oh. All right.

00:09:45.330 --> 00:09:47.830
Better than getting killed, I guess...

00:09:55.210 --> 00:09:58.290
Sheesh, the silence is way more nerve-wracking!

00:09:59.170 --> 00:10:03.830
It's fine, just stay quiet. You're going to live.
Don't mess that up by saying something!

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:07.830
Am I sure about that, though?

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:12.290
Who knows if this monster will decide to kill me
instead?!

00:10:13.630 --> 00:10:16.670
Ugh, this silence is killing me!
I gotta take my mind off all that!

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:21.880
Oh, right! Your name! What's your name?

00:10:28.210 --> 00:10:30.250
You have a name, don't you?

00:10:34.080 --> 00:10:38.170
You are the first devil to ask me for my name.

00:10:39.380 --> 00:10:41.000
Did he just smile?

00:10:44.750 --> 00:10:48.330
Most everyone born into this world are given a name.

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:53.420
And names are a treasure that each person possesses.

00:10:53.580 --> 00:10:55.210
That's what my father taught me.

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:57.500
Your father sounds wise.

00:10:57.960 --> 00:11:02.670
Telling someone else your name
is leaving proof that you were born.

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:08.960
As long as someone remembers your name,
you'll never be truly dead!

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:12.960
There'll always be proof that you were alive!

00:11:13.460 --> 00:11:16.670
That's how important sharing your name is!

00:11:17.540 --> 00:11:18.790
That logic does not compute.

00:11:21.580 --> 00:11:25.670
Sure, fine. No idea why I even started
talking about this anyways.

00:11:26.130 --> 00:11:30.250
Seems like I got him to feel
some sort of connection with me.

00:11:30.710 --> 00:11:33.130
And he seems happy that I asked for his name.

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:39.670
If that gets him to smile,
then he's not as different than I thought.

00:11:40.960 --> 00:11:41.750
What is it?

00:11:41.750 --> 00:11:42.880
Nothing, nothing.

00:11:42.880 --> 00:11:47.290
Just saying that sharing your name's important. Sorry
for the tangent.

00:11:47.670 --> 00:11:52.920
I'm Eibrad. Proud member of the Imps of the Dark Valley.

00:11:53.670 --> 00:11:54.880
Thank you.

00:11:55.500 --> 00:11:59.330
I am an Anti-Devil Self-Development Bioweapon,

00:11:59.710 --> 00:12:05.880
Demonhart Series Number 05, DH-05 Leo.

00:12:06.170 --> 00:12:07.170
You may call me Leo.

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:18.420
Out of nowhere, devils appeared in Tokyo.

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:23.040
Twelve bioweapons were made to defeat them.

00:12:23.830 --> 00:12:29.080
Unstoppable weapons designed to imitate
and eradicate devilkind, the Demonhart Series.

00:12:29.920 --> 00:12:32.420
I was one of them.

00:12:35.250 --> 00:12:39.830
We possessed power that surpassed
our invaders and unyielding fealty.

00:12:39.830 --> 00:12:43.960
We are humanity's fortress, blade, and shield.

00:12:44.460 --> 00:12:49.540
So the ONLY thing you were made
to do was protect humanity?

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:55.210
Yes. Our sole purpose is to fight
devilkind and protect humanity.

00:12:56.670 --> 00:12:59.000
That's kinda sad.

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:02.880
Is it? I feel no exhaustion from my duties,

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:06.460
and even if I did, protecting humanity is far too important.

00:13:06.460 --> 00:13:08.500
That's not what I meant.

00:13:11.880 --> 00:13:13.630
What a strange creature.

00:13:14.750 --> 00:13:16.920
He is a small devil, an "imp".

00:13:17.540 --> 00:13:21.670
Imps are intelligent, and many can speak
and understand human language.

00:13:22.630 --> 00:13:27.920
After hearing reports that an imp was preaching
coexistence in the Roppongi area,

00:13:28.210 --> 00:13:31.130
I headed straight to the scene and took it into custody.

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:33.460
As reports suggested, he was friendly,

00:13:33.920 --> 00:13:39.630
and I obtained plenty of useful information from him.

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:45.420
But amongst that information, he made some
statements that were incomprehensible.

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:46.830
A question, Imp.

00:13:46.830 --> 00:13:49.500
Eibrad! I just gave you my name!

00:13:49.790 --> 00:13:54.210
Eibrad, what did you mean by 'that's kinda sad'?

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:55.960
Just what I said.

00:13:56.670 --> 00:14:02.710
It makes my heart hurt when I think
about all the problems you're gonna face.

00:14:03.080 --> 00:14:05.000
I do not understand your statement.

00:14:05.710 --> 00:14:10.130
Look, Leo, your only reason for existing
is protecting humanity, right?

00:14:10.250 --> 00:14:10.960
Correct.

00:14:11.670 --> 00:14:12.750
Right, so listen.

00:14:12.750 --> 00:14:17.920
What're you gonna do when the war's over? Captain some
royal guard or some shit?

00:14:18.380 --> 00:14:22.830
No. I may not ally myself with
any one political entity or nation.

00:14:22.830 --> 00:14:27.080
I will remain on standby until another threat
to humanity's existence presents itself.

00:14:27.920 --> 00:14:30.830
Yeah, I figured you'd say as much.

00:14:32.250 --> 00:14:33.580
Wanna sit and talk?

00:14:34.960 --> 00:14:37.630
I suppose. There is time.

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:40.710
Your job's to protect humanity, huh?

00:14:41.250 --> 00:14:44.500
That only means it lasts for the war between us and you.

00:14:44.880 --> 00:14:49.960
Once the war's over, you won't have
a job anymore. Isn't that right?

00:14:50.830 --> 00:14:56.460
That's correct. If there is no enemy,
then the DH Series has no duties.

00:14:56.710 --> 00:14:59.080
And won't that just suck?

00:14:59.330 --> 00:15:05.750
You risk your life to win peace for the world,
then end up with no job or place to belong.

00:15:06.330 --> 00:15:08.710
I believe peace to be a desirable outcome.

00:15:08.710 --> 00:15:12.580
Not for you it ain't! Think about it!

00:15:13.000 --> 00:15:15.000
Think about the reason you exist!

00:15:15.710 --> 00:15:17.130
The reason I exist?

00:15:18.500 --> 00:15:21.880
When you were born, you already had
a reason for existing, clearly defined.

00:15:22.420 --> 00:15:27.130
But that reason's gonna be stripped away from you, and
you'll have to live on anyway.

00:15:27.290 --> 00:15:28.250
That's just...

00:15:28.920 --> 00:15:31.830
Horrible and cruel, if you ask me.

00:15:33.460 --> 00:15:34.960
Is that a threat?

00:15:34.960 --> 00:15:37.670
Like hell it's a threat! I'm worried about your well-being!

00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:41.250
A devil is worried about my well-being?

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:44.290
Yeah! So what?!

00:15:44.750 --> 00:15:46.670
Nothing. Please continue.

00:15:48.170 --> 00:15:52.500
Look, all I'm saying is when the world's finally at peace,

00:15:53.710 --> 00:15:55.540
for you, it'll be horrible.

00:15:56.290 --> 00:16:02.000
You'll wonder if the world needs you anymore.
That doubt'll slowly open a hole in your heart.

00:16:02.000 --> 00:16:05.580
And you said your kind doesn't die of old age, right?

00:16:05.920 --> 00:16:07.830
Correct, we do not.

00:16:08.250 --> 00:16:10.670
Death can be a blessing.

00:16:11.580 --> 00:16:16.460
Whether or not someone lives a good or bad life,
they all return to the earth in the end.

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:18.250
But not you.

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:25.130
Even after I am no longer needed to protect humanity
and lose my purpose, I will live on forever.

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:29.830
I will be whisked away from those wonderful times
when I knew my identity.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:34.210
I will be forced to move on,
confused and aimless, forever.

00:16:34.540 --> 00:16:36.080
That is what you mean to say, yes?

00:16:38.170 --> 00:16:39.170
Yeah.

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:44.750
If another war breaks out,
will I not have my purpose back again?

00:16:45.380 --> 00:16:50.710
Yeah, probably. With you living forever,
you'll end up saving the world forever.

00:16:51.000 --> 00:16:54.960
Getting back your purpose,
then losing it again, over and over.

00:16:55.580 --> 00:16:59.380
You're never gonna be able to rest peacefully.

00:16:59.750 --> 00:17:03.000
That's why I said it's really sad.

00:17:03.960 --> 00:17:06.580
My circumstances could be as he described.

00:17:07.420 --> 00:17:10.830
I will grow, but on the day I earn my humanity...

00:17:12.250 --> 00:17:15.920
On the day that the war between human
and devilkind is ended...

00:17:17.420 --> 00:17:21.710
I would be born to save the world,
yet there would be no place for me there.

00:17:22.380 --> 00:17:27.290
I would be born to save the world,
yet yearn for another cataclysm to come forth.

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:34.460
There would be a day where I questioned my way of life.

00:17:34.960 --> 00:17:38.290
If I did not die in this war before then.

00:17:39.500 --> 00:17:40.790
You needn't worry.

00:17:41.000 --> 00:17:45.500
Devilkind--no, demonkind's war
against humanity is intensifying.

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:46.330
What?

00:17:46.670 --> 00:17:51.710
Unfortunately, I am the weakest of the DH Series
weapons.

00:17:52.080 --> 00:17:56.080
The other DH units will likely defeat the demon army,

00:17:56.500 --> 00:18:01.830
but if they do not, the probability of my death
in battle before I earn my humanity is high.

00:18:02.210 --> 00:18:05.040
You're the weakest?! At your power level?!

00:18:05.290 --> 00:18:10.040
I am. That is why I have been building experience
by fighting far from the front lines.

00:18:11.500 --> 00:18:14.250
The humans sure have outdone
themselves with you guys, sheesh...

00:18:14.750 --> 00:18:20.380
So you're telling me you don't need to worry
about the future 'cause you're just gonna die?

00:18:20.710 --> 00:18:23.330
Yes, so you needn't worry.

00:18:23.750 --> 00:18:26.500
I do not think I will suffer as you imagine.

00:18:27.420 --> 00:18:32.460
Well, alright then. Sure.

00:18:32.830 --> 00:18:34.380
Here's to hopin'.

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:39.790
I'll be prayin' they kill you before you get too invincible.

00:18:40.540 --> 00:18:41.750
Thank you.

00:18:43.420 --> 00:18:44.880
You have to know I was bein' sarcastic!

00:18:52.250 --> 00:18:54.210
<b>Shibuya Station</b>

00:18:55.960 --> 00:18:57.040
They're here.

00:19:00.830 --> 00:19:02.290
The Containment Squadron.

00:19:04.080 --> 00:19:06.080
So I'm not makin' it home after all.

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:10.580
Fine, I'll do it! I'll see my bones
buried in the human world!

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:12.540
I'll live my whole damn life here!

00:19:13.170 --> 00:19:14.330
Your whole life?

00:19:14.330 --> 00:19:15.210
Yeah.

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:18.750
I'll find a way for demons and
humans to live in harmony.

00:19:19.080 --> 00:19:23.790
I'll keep asking everyone to put
down their arms and get along!

00:19:23.790 --> 00:19:24.920
Very well.

00:19:25.290 --> 00:19:27.790
If we are unable to send you back to the Demon World,

00:19:27.790 --> 00:19:30.330
we may need to consider coexistence ourselves.

00:19:30.880 --> 00:19:33.790
You remember my name now, all right?!

00:19:33.920 --> 00:19:41.630
When I bridge the gap between our peoples,
you better put up a statue of me and you!

00:19:43.710 --> 00:19:46.000
My work here is done.

00:19:49.040 --> 00:19:50.080
Hey, Leo!

00:19:52.580 --> 00:19:53.710
Hey, you listenin' to me?!

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:55.290
Don't work yourself to death!

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:59.130
If it hurts too much, get yourself the hell elsewhere!

00:19:59.580 --> 00:20:02.250
If life gets tough, then do what you wanna do!

00:20:02.250 --> 00:20:07.580
I don't know shit about bioweapons,
but you should live your life the way you want!

00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:10.790
I will.

00:20:12.380 --> 00:20:13.330
One more thing!

00:20:13.790 --> 00:20:19.500
Don't get too caught up in this
'born to protect humanity' shit!

00:20:19.830 --> 00:20:24.170
If humanity stops needing you, that's your chance!

00:20:24.960 --> 00:20:28.830
Find something else to live for and enjoy your life!

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:30.420
I will.

00:20:30.420 --> 00:20:33.580
Leo! I'll remember your name!

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:36.210
Don't you forget mine!

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:36.880
You got that?!

00:20:45.710 --> 00:20:50.040
He had so much to say,
yet I did not understand his words until the end.

00:20:50.330 --> 00:20:52.830
I kept them in my memory.

00:20:53.540 --> 00:20:57.210
If, on the small chance that life became too painful to live,

00:20:57.210 --> 00:20:59.710
I would do as I wished.

00:21:00.580 --> 00:21:05.630
I would forget about protecting humanity
and get myself the hell elsewhere.

00:21:06.170 --> 00:21:08.830
Very well, Eibrad.

00:21:10.880 --> 00:21:13.170
It was June 2060.

00:21:13.210 --> 00:21:18.710
<b>Tokyo,</b>

00:21:13.210 --> 00:21:18.710
<b>2060 A.D.</b>

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:16.670
A cold rain fell on the streets of Tokyo.

00:21:33.000 --> 00:21:36.960
I understand now, Eibrad, my wise friend.

00:21:39.040 --> 00:21:42.420
I'll use my life the way I want to.

00:21:43.130 --> 00:21:44.630
Now is the time.

00:21:48.210 --> 00:21:50.830
I trust them.

00:21:52.880 --> 00:21:55.290
I'll reveal everything to them today.

00:21:55.750 --> 00:21:59.380
That my name isn't Onyx, but Leo.

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:04.330
And I'll tell them the real reason I joined them.

00:23:35.920 --> 00:23:40.880
<b>Next Time:</b>

00:23:35.920 --> 00:23:40.880
<b>I Want</b>

00:23:35.920 --> 00:23:40.880
<b>to Quit</b>

00:23:35.920 --> 00:23:40.880
<b>Heroing</b>
